Prove fresh PAT exchange and signed environment claims through HTTPS

Usage: wamn-gates identity-session [OPTIONS] --issuer <ISSUER> --ca-file <CA_FILE> --cases-file <CASES_FILE>

Options:
      --issuer <ISSUER>          [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_ISSUER=]
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>    Log level (the Jobs pass this before the subcommand) [default: info]
      --ca-file <CA_FILE>        [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_CA_FILE=]
      --cases-file <CASES_FILE>  [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_SESSION_CASES_FILE=]
  -h, --help                     Print help
